{"sha": "75f2c0e17e40f5eae5f88d1bb3b568d0eb71c52a17da03ec35682a0f3de1218a", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:diffeq} 章 --- 线性微分方程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:1}", "齐次解：$y_h = \\lambda\\,\\eu^{-2x}$。特解：试取 $y_p =", "c\\,\\eu^{3x}$（$3$ 不是 $r + 2$ 的根）：$3c + 2c = 1$，$c =", "\\frac15$。通解：$y = \\frac{\\eu^{3x}}{5} +", "\\lambda\\,\\eu^{-2x}$。由 $y(0) = 1$ 得 $\\frac15 + \\lambda = 1$，", "$\\lambda = \\frac45$，于是 $y = \\frac{\\eu^{3x} + 4\\,\\eu^{-2x}}{5}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:2}", "在 $\\intoo{0}{+\\infty}$ 上，两边除以 $x$：$y' - \\frac{2}{x}\\,y = x^2$。", "此处 $A(x) = -2\\ln x$，$\\eu^{-A(x)} = x^2$：齐次解为", "$\\lambda x^2$。由常数变易法，$\\mu'(x) = x^2 \\cdot x^{-2} =", "1$，故 $\\mu = x + \\lambda$，于是", "\\[", "y(x) = x^3 + \\lambda x^2, \\qquad \\lambda \\in \\R .", "\\]", "\\emph{验证：}$x(3x^2 + 2\\lambda x) - 2(x^3 + \\lambda x^2) = x^3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:3}", "$y'' - 3y' + 2y = 0$：根为 $1$ 与 $2$；$\\;y = \\lambda\\,\\eu^{x} +", "\\mu\\,\\eu^{2x}$。", "", "$y'' + 4y' + 4y = 0$：二重根 $-2$；$\\;y = (\\lambda + \\mu", "x)\\,\\eu^{-2x}$。", "", "$y'' - 2y' + 5y = 0$：根为 $1 \\pm 2\\iu$；$\\;y = \\eu^{x}(\\lambda\\cos", "2x + \\mu\\sin 2x)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:4}", "齐次解：根为 $\\pm 1$，$y_h = \\lambda\\,\\eu^x + \\mu\\,\\eu^{-x}$。", "右端为多项式（$\\gamma = 0$ 不是根），设特解：", "$y_p = ax^2 + bx + c$；代入得 $2a - (ax^2 + bx + c) = x^2$，", "比较系数得 $a = -1$，$b = 0$，$c = 2a = -2$，即 $y_p = -x^2 - 2$。通解为", "$y = -x^2 - 2 + \\lambda\\eu^x + \\mu\\eu^{-x}$。", "", "柯西问题：$y(0) = -2 + \\lambda + \\mu = 0$，且 $y'(0) = \\lambda - \\mu =", "1$，得 $\\lambda = \\frac32$，$\\mu = \\frac12$。于是", "$y = -x^2 - 2 + \\frac{3\\eu^x + \\eu^{-x}}{2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:5}", "$a(x) = \\tan x$，$A(x) = -\\ln(\\cos x)$（该区间上 $\\cos > 0$，", "故有意义），$\\eu^{-A} = \\cos x$：齐次解为 $\\lambda\\cos x$。", "由常数变易法，$\\mu'(x) = \\sin 2x \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos x} =", "2\\sin x$，故 $\\mu = -2\\cos x + \\lambda$，于是", "\\[", "y(x) = -2\\cos^2 x + \\lambda \\cos x .", "\\]", "\\emph{验证：}$y' = 4\\cos x \\sin x - \\lambda\\sin x$，且 $y\\tan x =", "-2\\cos x\\sin x + \\lambda \\sin x$，二者之和为 $2\\cos x\\sin x =", "\\sin 2x$，与要求相符。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:6}", "$\\chi(r) = r^2 - 4r + 3 = (r-1)(r-3)$：$\\gamma = 1$ 为单根", "（$m = 1$）。试取 $y_p = x(ax + b)\\,\\eu^x$。记 $u = ax^2 + bx$，", "\\[", "y_p'' - 4y_p' + 3y_p = \\bigl(u'' + (2 - 4)u' + \\chi(1) u\\bigr)\\eu^x", "= \\bigl(2a - 2(2ax + b)\\bigr)\\eu^x .", "\\]", "与 $(2x + 1)\\eu^x$ 比较系数：$-4a = 2$，$2a - 2b = 1$，于是 $a =", "-\\frac12$，$b = -1$。通解为", "\\[", "y = -\\Bigl(\\frac{x^2}{2} + x\\Bigr)\\eu^{x} + \\lambda\\,\\eu^{x} +", "\\mu\\,\\eu^{3x}, \\qquad (\\lambda, \\mu) \\in \\R^2 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:7}", "齐次解：$y_h = \\lambda\\cos 2x + \\mu\\sin 2x$。", "", "右端为 $x$（$\\gamma = 0$ 不是根），设 $y_1 = ax + b$，", "代入得 $4(ax + b) = x$，即 $y_1 = \\frac x4$。", "", "右端为 $\\sin 2x = \\Im(\\eu^{2\\iu x})$，且 $2\\iu$ 是", "$r^2 + 4$ 的单根：试取 $z = c\\,x\\,\\eu^{2\\iu x}$，则 $z'' + 4z =", "4\\iu c\\,\\eu^{2\\iu x}$，令其等于 $\\eu^{2\\iu x}$，取 $c =", "\\frac{1}{4\\iu} = -\\frac{\\iu}{4}$，于是 $z = -\\frac{\\iu x}{4}(\\cos 2x +", "\\iu \\sin 2x)$，故 $y_2 = \\Im(z) = -\\frac{x\\cos 2x}{4}$。", "", "由叠加原理，", "\\[", "y = \\frac{x}{4} - \\frac{x\\cos 2x}{4} + \\lambda\\cos 2x + \\mu\\sin 2x .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:8}", "方程 $T' + kT = 20k$ 的常值特解为 $20$，", "齐次解为 $\\lambda\\eu^{-kt}$，故 $T(t) = 20 +", "\\lambda\\,\\eu^{-kt}$。由 $T(0) = 80$ 得 $\\lambda = 60$：", "\\[", "T(t) = 20 + 60\\,\\eu^{-kt} .", "\\]", "由 $T(10) = 50$ 得 $\\eu^{-10k} = \\frac12$，故 $k = \\frac{\\ln 2}{10}$。于是", "$T(t) = 25$ 要求 $\\eu^{-kt} = \\frac{5}{60} = \\frac{1}{12}$，即", "\\[", "t = \\frac{\\ln 12}{k} = 10\\,\\frac{\\ln 12}{\\ln 2} \\approx 35.8", "\\text{ 分钟.}", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:diffeq:9}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $\\chi(r) = r^2 + 2\\varepsilon r + 1$，$\\Delta = 4(\\varepsilon^2", "        - 1)$。", "        当 $\\varepsilon \\in \\intco{0}{1}$ 时，根为 $-\\varepsilon \\pm", "        \\iu\\sqrt{1 - \\varepsilon^2}$，故", "        $y = \\eu^{-\\varepsilon t}\\bigl(\\lambda\\cos\\omega t +", "        \\mu\\sin\\omega t\\bigr)$，其中 $\\omega = \\sqrt{1 -", "        \\varepsilon^2}$。", "        当 $\\varepsilon = 1$ 时，二重根为 $-1$，$y = (\\lambda + \\mu", "        t)\\,\\eu^{-t}$。", "        当 $\\varepsilon > 1$ 时，实根为 $r_\\pm = -\\varepsilon \\pm", "        \\sqrt{\\varepsilon^2 - 1}$，二者均 $< 0$，且 $y =", "        \\lambda\\eu^{r_+t} + \\mu\\eu^{r_-t}$。", "  \\item 当 $\\varepsilon \\in \\intoo{0}{1}$ 时，$\\abs y \\leq", "        \\eu^{-\\varepsilon t}(\\abs\\lambda + \\abs\\mu) \\to 0$。当", "        $\\varepsilon = 1$ 时，$(\\lambda + \\mu t)\\eu^{-t} \\to 0$", "        （指数因子压过多项式，", "        见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}）。当 $\\varepsilon > 1$ 时，", "        由 $r_\\pm < 0$ 知两个指数项均衰减（事实上", "        $\\sqrt{\\varepsilon^2 - 1} < \\varepsilon$）。当 $\\varepsilon =", "        0$ 时，$y = \\lambda\\cos t + \\mu\\sin t$ 的振幅恒为", "        $\\sqrt{\\lambda^2 + \\mu^2} \\neq 0$，除非 $y = 0$。", "  \\item 写成 $\\lambda\\cos\\omega t + \\mu\\sin\\omega t =", "        R\\cos(\\omega t - \\varphi)$，其中 $R = \\sqrt{\\lambda^2 + \\mu^2}", "        > 0$。$y$ 的零点与 $\\cos(\\omega t -", "        \\varphi)$ 的零点相同（因子 $\\eu^{-\\varepsilon t}$ 永不", "        为零）：$\\omega t - \\varphi \\equiv \\frac\\pi2 \\pmod \\pi$，", "        即零点构成公差为 $\\frac{\\pi}{\\omega} =", "        \\frac{\\pi}{\\sqrt{1 - \\varepsilon^2}}$ 的等差数列。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", ""]}